@StudyFlowApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5130
# Substituir taskId pelo id retornado no cadastro.
@taskId = 1

### 1. Criar tarefa — 201 Created; Location contém a rota do recurso
POST {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Minimal APIs",
  "description": "Revisar endpoints e programação assíncrona",
  "dueDate": null,
  "priority": "High"
}

### 2. Listar todas as tarefas — 200 OK
GET {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filtrar tarefas pendentes — 200 OK
GET {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?status=Pending
Accept: application/json

### 4. Buscar tarefa por ID — 200 OK
GET {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Atualizar tarefa — 200 OK
PUT {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Minimal APIs e EF Core",
  "description": "Conteúdo revisado e exercício concluído",
  "dueDate": null,
  "priority": "High",
  "status": "Completed"
}

### 6. Rejeitar título vazio — 400 Bad Request
POST {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": " ",
  "dueDate": null,
  "priority": "High"
}

### 7. Excluir tarefa — 204 No Content
DELETE {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}

### 8. Confirmar exclusão — 404 Not Found
GET {{StudyFlowApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}
Accept: application/json
